00:12:11.230 --> 00:12:12.650
Well, that's all I got, lady.

257
00:12:12.890 --> 00:12:14.090
I loved it all.

258
00:12:14.450 --> 00:12:19.010
Well, let's take a break because when we come back, you guys, the Saber Store is opening.

259
00:12:19.510 --> 00:12:20.150
It is.

260
00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:21.050
It's opening day.

261
00:12:21.350 --> 00:12:34.950
We are back with a Dwight talking head.

