00:12:35.070 --> 00:12:40.170
He's going to share with us that today is the test launch of the inaugural Saber Store.

263
00:12:40.310 --> 00:12:41.130
And he's in charge.

264
00:12:41.130 --> 00:12:44.570
And if all goes well, he's going to get that VP position.

265
00:12:44.870 --> 00:12:45.210
Mm-hmm.

