00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:50.490
As Dwight is giving this talking head, you get to see a little bit of the store behind him.

267
00:12:50.570 --> 00:12:50.930
Mm-hmm.

268
00:12:51.230 --> 00:12:54.610
So I was curious what it said in the shooting draft about this store.

