00:12:55.130 --> 00:12:55.990
Here's what it said.

270
00:12:56.190 --> 00:12:58.390
The store is new and shiny.

271
00:12:58.890 --> 00:13:05.470
Inside, we see pyramids, the tablet of tomorrow, arrowheads, the phone of the future,

272
00:13:06.170 --> 00:13:12.590
Saber printers and fax machines, a promotional cutout of NBC's Chuck using a pyramid.

273
00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:15.070
So this got me curious.

274
00:13:15.830 --> 00:13:20.870
I was wondering if there were other big tech companies that had big store openings like this.

275
00:13:20.930 --> 00:13:21.210
Mm-hmm.

276
00:13:21.470 --> 00:13:24.330
Kind of back in the day when we would have been writing this.

277
00:13:24.490 --> 00:13:25.850
And I found something.

