279
00:13:29.310 --> 00:13:34.130
I read this article on Inc.com about Apple's first ever retail store.

280
00:13:34.450 --> 00:13:35.850
And Jenna, where was it?

281
00:13:35.990 --> 00:13:37.310
Oh, that's such a great question.

282
00:13:37.310 --> 00:13:39.710
I was just going to ask you if you could guess.

