00:18:47.210 --> 00:18:53.110
There was an extended scene when everyone is arriving for the day to come work in the new

390
00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:53.790
Sabre store.

391
00:18:54.410 --> 00:19:00.730
Each Dunder Mifflin Sabre employee walks past the Chuck poster and they all do like, you

392
00:19:00.730 --> 00:19:04.170
know, the two fingers where you kiss the two fingers and then you pat it on something.

393
00:19:04.350 --> 00:19:05.410
Like a good luck thing?

394
00:19:05.450 --> 00:19:08.470
Yeah, they all go and they like kind of pat his forehead.

395
00:19:09.230 --> 00:19:14.830
Everyone does it except Aaron who hugs him and Stanley just walks by him indifferently.

396
00:19:15.390 --> 00:19:19.470
And Brent shared that Mindy was very fond of this cardboard cutout.

397
00:19:19.730 --> 00:19:20.470
She was.

