00:19:27.690 --> 00:19:29.390
And she would hang things on it.

403
00:19:29.670 --> 00:19:32.550
Like she'd put her hat on it or a coat.

404
00:19:32.750 --> 00:19:33.370
Her hoodie or, yeah.

405
00:19:33.450 --> 00:19:33.670
Yeah.

406
00:19:33.830 --> 00:19:37.450
So you could go in there and it would be sort of like a dress up cutout.

407
00:19:37.750 --> 00:19:38.190
Yeah.

408
00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:43.390
And if her door was open, if you were walking down the hallway, you always saw Zachary Levi's.

409
00:19:43.390 --> 00:19:46.290
And sometimes you'd forget and think a person was in there.

410
00:19:46.370 --> 00:19:46.510
Yeah.

411
00:19:46.670 --> 00:19:48.550
Or that Zachary Levi was in there.

412
00:19:48.650 --> 00:19:48.790
Yeah.

